A||N||5||2xsess||Started FastBack conversion today.||||6||
Z||000000||2xsess||10-09-2000||12:13 AM||||Well, SDM1964 drug home this poor ugly 86GT all the way from SC, <BR>Here's Steve having fun trying to get a jack under the back to remove the flat tire. Doesn't he look happy. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/happy_Steve.jpg"> <P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Aftertires.jpg">  <P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Goin_bye-bye.jpg">  <P>After 10hours of driving, five of them I followed this tragedy home, staring at it's sad face. At one point Steve hit a bump and the nose flipped up like it was waving at me.<P>We got the fastback clip off today. I'm still amazed by the awesome frame on these cars.<P>Here's the recipient.Gold 86SE automatic. Steve picked this one up for $400, the tan interior is almost mint. One of the heads was cracked so the cradle sits in his garage.<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Gold_SE.jpg">  <P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/recipient.jpg">  <P><BR>Well I'm just having so much fun doing this I had to share with all of you.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>More to come I'm sure.<P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>85GT<p>[This message has been edited by 2xsess (edited 10-09-2000).]||||reg||6
