Z||000002||2xsess||10-09-2000||12:37 AM||||Actually it was a very faded maroon I think, but yes it looks pinkish. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>85GT||||reg||1
Z||000003||sdm1964||10-09-2000||06:30 AM||||Hey for a hundred bucks, it could have been bright pink!!I got all the peices in need for the conversion, lace rims, 120 speedo, a set of aux guages for my 85 GT.I also got a nice set of heads to rework to put on the gold SE. We installed the dash,interior peices and power mirrors to 2xses's GT. Jeff also scored a nice set of grey lace rims for his GT. We were like 2 kids at x-mas.||||reg||1
Z||000004||Cheever2||10-09-2000||06:42 AM||||He looked a little too happy... been sippin' the ol' Kickapoo Joy Juice have we?  Let's see him smiling when the project's half done, yeah.<P>Noticed the firefighter decal on the notchback.  I'm a FK (fireman's kid).<P>||||reg||1
Z||000005||2xsess||10-09-2000||10:03 AM||||Steve, I wasn't knocking it but.......DAMN it's ugly. But we'll fix that.<P>Yes we were like two kids in a candy store.(Fieros, what can be sweeter?) <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>85GT||||reg||1
